    "innovation": "This paper systematically evaluates different ocean representations in GCMs, demonstrating that simplified mixed-layer and climatological SST models introduce significant errors in the mean position of Northern Hemisphere storm tracks, primarily by failing to capture crucial interannual variability like the El Ni\u00f1o/Southern Oscillation (ENSO).",
